  "description": "FirstCommit '26 – CampusCode's Inaugural Hackathon FirstCommit '26 is the first hackathon hosted on CampusCode, a student-built platform dedicated exclusively to hackathons. This is a 24-hour, fully online hackathon open to college students across India. How to Participate: Join the official WhatsApp Channel for announcements: https://chat.whatsapp.com/GvG0CuwqKwM1v1rfZ7kgQP?s=cl&p=a&mlu=4&ilr=4 Build your solution, submit it round by round, and present it to the judges. Tracks: Build for Campus: Solve real problems related to college life. AI in Action: Build AI agents, automation tools, or LLM-based applications. Open Innovation: Create any bold and innovative solution. Team Size: 1–4 members. Inter-college teams are allowed. Eligibility: College students across India. Entry Fee: Completely free. Prizes and Rewards: ₹3,000 prize pool for the top three teams. Certificates for every participant. Winners will be featured on CampusCode's LinkedIn.Format: 24 hours, comprising three rounds: Round 1: Idea submission. Round 2: Build and submit. Round 3: Final review by judges. Dates: 14–15 November 2026 (tentative). Final dates will be announced on the official WhatsApp Channel. Build something real. Be part of the first commit.",
