    "details": "<p><strong>FirstCommit '26 &ndash; CampusCode's Inaugural Hackathon FirstCommit '26 is the first hackathon hosted on CampusCode, a student-built platform dedicated exclusively to hackathons. This is a 24-hour, fully online hackathon open to college students across India. How to Participate:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>Join the official WhatsApp Channel for announcements: <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/GvG0CuwqKwM1v1rfZ7kgQP?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/GvG0CuwqKwM1v1rfZ7kgQP?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4</a></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Build your solution, submit it round by round, and present it to the judges. Tracks:</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Build for Campus: Solve real problems related to college life.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>AI in Action: Build AI agents, automation tools, or LLM-based applications.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Open Innovation: Create any bold and innovative solution. Team Size: 1&ndash;4 members.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Inter-college teams are allowed.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Eligibility: College students across India.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Entry Fee: Completely free.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Prizes and Rewards:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>₹3,000 prize pool for the top three teams.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Certificates for every participant.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>Winners will be featured on CampusCode's LinkedIn.Format: 24 hours, comprising three rounds:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>Round 1: Idea submission.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Round 2: Build and submit.</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>Round 3: Final review by judges. Dates: 14&ndash;15 November 2026 (tentative). Final dates will be announced on the official WhatsApp Channel.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Build something real. Be part of the first commit.</p>",
